  "title": "A Homemade San Francisco Treat: Chicken Vermicelli Rice",
  "description": "This versatile homemade chicken rice side dish simmers rice and pieces of vermicelli pasta in a mixture of garlic and onion powders, chicken bouillon granules, and water.",
